Third-party attributions for Workaholic-Willy.

Add an entry in the same commit that introduces a dependency, a vendored file, or an asset source.
Format: <name> <version> — <license> — <source URL>

This file is the ONE place where a third-party project may be named together with its licence,
so that the project can be redistributed in compliance with its licence.
If a dependency is removed, its entry may be removed here in the same commit.


